• Deliver outstanding customer support via phone, email, chat, and social media;

• Assist customers with booking questions and transportation-related inquiries;

• Answer incoming phone calls from drivers and help resolve their issues;

• Handle and track customer support tickets in Freshdesk;

• Escalate complex cases to the relevant internal teams;

• Build strong and lasting customer relationships;

• Handle sensitive customer data with care and security;

• Apply the latest and greatest customer happiness practices;

• Maintain a deep understanding of the client’s solutions and meet KPIs.

What you need to succeed in this role:

• Native Spanish and excellent English communication skills (at least C1 for both spoken and written);

•
At least 1 year of customer service experience ;

• Strong communication and problem-solving skills;

• Ability to handle customer inquiries across multiple communication channels;

• Responsible, proactive, and customer-oriented attitude;

• Personal computer (at least 8Gb of RAM) with a stable internet connection (minimum 50 Mbps-download and 40 Mbps-upload).

Will be a great plus:

• Experience in logistics, transportation, or travel-related customer service;

• Experience with Freshdesk.

Benefits:

•
Fixed schedule : Monday-Friday, 5 AM-1 PM (GMT-3) ;

